  "summary": "Selected evidence records: Reasonix implements Agent Client Protocol v1 as an NDJSON JSON-RPC 2.0 agent over stdin/stdout, launched via `reasonix acp`, with diagnostics sent to stderr. ACP exposes session lifecycle methods including session/new, load, resume, prompt, cancel, list, close, and delete, each session owning an isolated controller, workspace root, model, and transcript.",
